sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as EPP (ExternalProcessor)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelPod as Model Server Pod
    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS
    participant Render as Rendering Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant IGW as Inference Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant Sidecar as PD-Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker
    participant Encode as Encode Worker
    participant Decode as Decode Server
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>6379/TCP

    Note over Client,ModelPod: Flow 1: Envoy ext-proc Routing (EPP)
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Envoy->>EPP: ext-proc ProcessingRequest<br/>gRPC (Optional TLS)
    EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, Pods<br/>HTTPS ServiceAccount
    EPP->>ModelPod: Scrape metrics/DCGM<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (InsecureSkipVerify)
    EPP-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>(routing headers)
    Envoy->>ModelPod: Forward to selected pod<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Client,Redis: Flow 2: Disaggregated Inference (Coordinator E/P/D)
    Client->>Coord: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Coord->>Render: Tokenize + preprocess<br/>HTTP (no encryption)
    Coord->>IGW: Encode request<br/>HTTP
    IGW-->>Coord: Encode result + transfer descriptor
    Coord->>IGW: Prefill request<br/>HTTP
    IGW-->>Coord: Prefill result + KV-cache descriptor
    Coord->>IGW: Decode request<br/>HTTP
    IGW-->>Coord: SSE stream
    Coord-->>Client: SSE stream response<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,Redis: Flow 2b: Async Inference (Coordinator + Redis)
    Client->>Coord: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(async mode)
    Coord->>Redis: Enqueue request<br/>TCP (no encryption)
    Coord-->>Client: 202 Accepted + request ID
    Client->>Coord: GET /v1/requests/{id}<br/>Poll result
    Coord->>Redis: Check queue
    Coord-->>Client: Result or pending

    Note over Sidecar,Decode: Flow 3: Sidecar Disaggregated Routing
    Envoy->>Sidecar: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Sidecar->>Prefill: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (Configurable TLS)
    Prefill-->>Sidecar: Prefill result + KV descriptor
    Sidecar->>Encode: Encode request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (Configurable TLS)
    Encode-->>Sidecar: Encode result + embedding descriptor
    Sidecar->>Decode: Decode request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (co-located)
    Decode-->>Sidecar: SSE stream
    Sidecar-->>Envoy: SSE stream response
